{"speciesId":381,"names":{"fr":"Latios","es":"Latios","en":"Latios","ja":"ラティオス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LATIOS has the ability to make its foe see an image of what it has seen or imagines in its head. This POKéMON is intelligent and understands human speech."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LATIOS will only open its heart to a TRAINER with a compassionate spirit. This POKéMON can fly faster than a jet plane by folding its forelegs to minimize air resistance."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Even in hiding, it can detect the locations of others and sense their emotions since it has telepathy. Its intelligence allows it to understand human languages."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It has a docile temperament and dislikes fighting. Tucking in its forelegs, it can fly faster than a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It has a docile temperament and dislikes fighting. Tucking in its forelegs, it can fly faster than a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un Pokémon très intelligent. Il peut voler plus vite qu’un avion à réaction en repliant ses ailes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding 