l lenguaje humano."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Latios has the ability to make others see an image of what it has seen or imagines in its head. This Pokémon is intelligent and understands human speech."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"見た ものや 考えた イメージを 相手に 映像として 見せる 能力を 持つ。 人間の 言葉を 理解することが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Latios n’ouvrira son cœur qu’à un Dresseur doté d’un esprit compatissant. Ce Pokémon peut voler plus vite qu’un avion à réaction en repliant ses pattes avant pour améliorer son aérodynamisme."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Latios solo le abre el corazón a los Entrenadores compasivos. A la hora de volar, este Pokémon pliega las patas delanteras para minimizar la resistencia al aire y supera en velocidad a un avión a reacción."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Latios will only open its heart to a Trainer with a compassionate spirit. This Pokémon can fly faster than a jet plane by folding its forelegs to minimize air resistance."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"優しい 心の 持ち主にしか なつかない。 腕を 折り畳むと 空気抵抗が 減って ジェット機 よりも 速く 空を 飛べるぞ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":381,"moves":[{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fly","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],